    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 1.5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hine hwa forstonde, forgilde hine be his were, swa þam cyninge swa ðam ðe hit mid ryhte togebyrige; ⁊ ælc man ðara ðe þær midstande gesylle ðam cyninge CXX scll' to wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone defends him, he shall pay for him to the amount of his wergeld either to the king or to him to whom it is legally due, and everyone who renders him assistance shall pay a fine of 120 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwa hine forstande, forgylde hine be his were, swa ðam cynge swa ðam ðe hit togebyrige; ⁊ ælc man ðara ðe ðær midstande gesylle hundtwelftig scill' to wite ðam cynge.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
